{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(not_recommended)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (not recommended)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is one of the imaginary roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e390522d6104c62f7dac4039bfc6f4dcec257f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />, then the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/713809f9f2e6ddee98cb57e3ee85f45c257e8f69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-w+w^2)(1+w-w^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"19\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3d6f24475d04ac68dbd2b8c7770d35efd7ac87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }4\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }w\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }w^2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"368\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding the given expression yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7ca588f79a7fe0ec96826a26344b18e8e271cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+w-w^2-w-w^2+w^3+w^2+w^3-w^4=1-w^2+2w^3-w^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"513\" height=\"18\" />. Recalling that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/c/f7c8a1623785d651cf84f09ca5c2823ea722649d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w^3=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />, we see that this expression equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a412e71eb4373f583492e3f4ee674c4d4215ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-w^2+2-w=4-(1+w+w^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"279\" height=\"21\" />. By the properties of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Roots_of_unity\" title=\"Roots of unity\">roots of unity</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb1ab8d2508837ec1af04d01a2d3c8609ef08bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8beb4549b50e870ec3ebbe0d399e1b158235ff5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w^2+w+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" />, so the given expression equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c10a3d07b58752df775b398437ef439ed551099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28not_recommended.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(not_recommended)\">Solution 2 (not recommended)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (not recommended)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/6/7b62c6c0b9b5182fd201fb67463c65ce428a02ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=e^{i\\tfrac{2\\pi}3}=\\cos(\\tfrac{2\\pi}3)+i\\sin(\\tfrac{2\\pi}3) = \\tfrac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"318\" height=\"31\" />. Substituting this into the given expression, we can calculate the result:\n\\begin{align*}\n(1-w+w^2)(1+w-w^2) &amp;= (1-\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2+(\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2)^2)(1+\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2-(\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2)^2) \\\\\n&amp;= (1-\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}{2}+\\frac{1-3-2i\\sqrt3}{4})(1+\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2-\\frac{1-3-2i\\sqrt3}{4}) \\\\\n&amp;= (1-\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}{2}+\\frac{-1-i\\sqrt3}{2})(1+\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}2-\\frac{-1-i\\sqrt3}{2}) \\\\\n&amp;= (1-2(\\frac{i\\sqrt3}2))(1+2(\\frac{i\\sqrt3}2)) \\\\\n&amp;= 1^2-(i\\sqrt3)^2 \\\\\n&amp;= 1+3 \\\\\n&amp;= 4\n\\end{align*}\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c10a3d07b58752df775b398437ef439ed551099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems